                "entry_id": "e8dee69e-1393-3ac4-9ff4-472e5f4929d6",
                "word": "Hannan",
                "pos": "name",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "7a9cff25-5fdd-37c3-a92c-167a63d1c734",
                        "entry_id": "e8dee69e-1393-3ac4-9ff4-472e5f4929d6",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A district of Wuhan, Hubei, China."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "6b7495dd-d147-47ce-b0de-7002d54d0278",
                                "sense_id": "7a9cff25-5fdd-37c3-a92c-167a63d1c734",
                                "text": "In five years, a large agricultural sightseeing zone will emerge in Hannan District of Wuhan City. The project was launched early this year.\nHannan District, surrounded by three rivers — the Yangtze River,[...]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "16bc875f-bb39-4790-bd97-ff446451b305",
                                "sense_id": "7a9cff25-5fdd-37c3-a92c-167a63d1c734",
                                "text": "When an elderly Wuhan man in a wheelchair pushed his sick wife into the Yangtze River and killed her on her request, he never thought he would be a murderer.[…]\nStill, the Hannan district court sentenced the 70-year-old to four years of jail for euthanasia in August."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2f251e48-8fac-4211-8a63-268d81363d62",
                                "sense_id": "7a9cff25-5fdd-37c3-a92c-167a63d1c734",
                                "text": "For the understanding convenience, in this study, we took the facet figure spot data of the land use status data sets collected in Hannan district of Wuhan city as an example, referred the uniformity treatment flow scheme and introduced the basic steps and the related principles of application of FEM and its expended modules MyFME to conduct uniformity treatment."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d335c14c-9cf5-4020-8673-280f1974732b",
                                "sense_id": "7a9cff25-5fdd-37c3-a92c-167a63d1c734",
                                "text": "There are three procedures including data preprocessing, tag, and modeling. The first step is the preprocessing including extracting information from the database of land in Hannan district, Wuhan city, Hubei province, China. Next, some parameters and features are calculated."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4e2675aa-5666-43a5-9e8b-a7a40a7b55c0",
                                "sense_id": "7a9cff25-5fdd-37c3-a92c-167a63d1c734",
                                "text": "“He had been hiding it from me and my mom. He wouldn’t talk to us about his physical condition,” said his daughter Yang Jingjing, who had been quarantined in her apartment in Wuhan’s Wuchung district after returning from her parents’ home across town in the Hannan district. “I just want to find my dad.”[...]\nYang Yuanyun was last seen by a police surveillance camera on the southern bank of the Yangtze River, near Shamao Town in the Hannan district."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
